<Center><DIV STYLE="width:8.5in" align="left">
 <P STYLE="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman"><B>About Qnity</B></P>
<P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">Qnity<SUP STYLE="font-size:75%; vertical-align:top">&#153;</SUP> is a premier technology provider across the semiconductor value chain, empowering AI, high
performance computing, and advanced connectivity. From groundbreaking solutions for semiconductor chip manufacturing, to enabling high-speed transmission within complex electronic systems, our high-performance materials and integration expertise
make tomorrow&#8217;s technologies possible. More information about the company, its businesses and solutions can be found at <U>www.qnityelectronics.com</U>. </P>
<P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">Qnity<SUP STYLE="font-size:75%; vertical-align:top">&#153;</SUP>, the Qnity Node Logo, and all products, unless otherwise noted, denoted with TM&nbsp;or <SUP
STYLE="font-size:75%; vertical-align:top">&reg;</SUP> are trademarks, trade names or registered trademarks of affiliates of Qnity Electronics, Inc. </P>
<P STYLE="margin-top:18pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman"><B>Cautionary Statement Regarding Forward-Looking Statements </B></P>
<P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">This release contains forward-looking statements. Forward-looking statements use words such as &#8220;plans&#8221;, &#8220;expects&#8221;, &#8220;will&#8221;,
